# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0063.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Web Client -> Ingress / TLS
Ingress / TLS -> SalesPipe Spring Boot App
SalesPipe Spring Boot App -> PostgreSQL - managed / StatefulSet
SalesPipe Spring Boot App -> Redis
SalesPipe Spring Boot App -> Kafka Cluster: produce domain events
Kafka Cluster -> Activity Timeline Consumer
Kafka Cluster -> Notification Consumer
Kafka Cluster -> Lead Score Recompute Consumer
Kafka Cluster -> Email Event Consumer
Activity Timeline Consumer -> PostgreSQL - managed / StatefulSet
Notification Consumer -> PostgreSQL - managed / StatefulSet
Email Event Consumer -> PostgreSQL - managed / StatefulSet
Lead Score Recompute Consumer -> Lead Scoring Service - FastAPI: feature vector
Lead Scoring Service - FastAPI -> Lead Score Recompute Consumer: score
Lead Score Recompute Consumer -> PostgreSQL - managed / StatefulSet
SalesPipe Spring Boot App -> Lead Scoring Service - FastAPI: sync scoring call optional

Client { Web Client }
K8s Cluster { Monolith Pods - HPA 3-10 replicas, ML Service Pods, Ingress / TLS, Redis, PostgreSQL - managed / StatefulSet, Kafka Cluster }
Monolith Pods - HPA 3-10 replicas { SalesPipe Spring Boot App }
ML Service Pods { Lead Scoring Service - FastAPI }
Async Consumers in-process { Activity Timeline Consumer, Notification Consumer, Lead Score Recompute Consumer, Email Event Consumer }
